WEBVTT

00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:31.656
možda se i život začeo.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.576
Kjuriositi je takođe bušio to crveno tlo

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.576
i doneo je druge materijale.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:39.256
I bili smo zaista uzbuđeni
kad smo to videli.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.296
Jer Mars nije bio crven,

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.936
radilo se o sivom materijalu,

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:44.256
Mars je siv.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.736
Stavili smo to u rover,

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.376
okusili ga

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.856
i znate šta?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.896
Okusili smo organske materije -

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.296
ugljenik, vodonik, kiseonik,

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.816
azot, fosfor, sumpor -

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.216
sve je bilo tu.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.736
Dakle, Mars je u prošlosti,

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.096
s mnogo vode,